/-- **What an `NttElem` holds.**  Lanes `0 … 255` are the `q₁` residues of the leaf-level
transform of `g`, lanes `256 … 511` the `q₂` ones, and both are centred — which is exactly the
input `pointwise_mul_acc`'s product bound assumes. -/
